      "steps": [
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Cut the tomatoes into wedges, the cucumber into thick half slices and the pepper into rings; take the seeds out of the pepper first.",
            "de": "Die Tomaten in Spalten, die Gurke in dicke halbe Scheiben und die Paprika in Ringe schneiden; die Paprika vorher entkernen."
          },
